Qt 6.12 added a QtQuick Color type that shadows Omarchy's Color singleton: the bar, notifications and lock screen lose
their theme colours (Color.bar etc. undefined). Omarchy's Quickshell 0.3.2-4 carries a workaround that rewrites
"import QtQuick" to "import QtQuick 6.11", but only when shell.qml has this pragma: omarchy commit 51717f10b
(2026-10-10), which the aarch64 omarchy 4.0.4-2 package doesn't include yet. Skipped once a release has it.

--- a/shell/shell.qml
+++ b/shell/shell.qml
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+//@ pragma OmarchyLoadPatch
 import QtQuick
 import QtQml.Models
 import Quickshell
